      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salisbury%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2008, Salisbury’s downtown received major sidewalk and road work, adding replica early‑20th‑century‑style streetlights.",
